---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import { currently } from "@data/hobbies";
---

<Section
  id="about"
  eyebrow="01 / whoami"
  title="Backend engineer, ex‑computational biochemist, full‑time craft enthusiast"
>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm a software engineer at <strong>AI-Media</strong> in Toronto, and a primary backend
        engineer who owns <strong>Lexi</strong>, <strong>Translate</strong>, and
        <strong>Voice Cloud</strong>, the company's key live captioning, translation, and voice
        dubbing products. I take features from technical design to production, run planning, and
        answer the alerts when something breaks.
      </p>
      <p>
        My path here took the scenic route. I did a BMSc and an MSc in computational biochemistry,
        simulating disordered proteins with molecular dynamics. Then I spent a year as a
        <em>respeaker</em>, voicing live captions for classes in real time. That's where I got
        curious about the software underneath, and I've been building it ever since.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like systems that are a bit messy, code that's kind to the next person, and releases that
        go out boringly. Off the clock I'm usually stitching something tiny.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="currently card patch" aria-label="What I'm up to right now">
      <p class="currently-title mono">$ cat ~/currently.txt</p>
      <dl>
        {currently.map(({ label, value }) => (
          <div class="row">
            <dt class="mono">{label}:</dt>
            <dd>{value}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .currently {
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-5) var(--space-5);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    rotate: 1.2deg;
  }

  .currently-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-accent-2);
  }

  dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0 var(--space-2);
  }

  dt {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (min-width: 52rem) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
